+/*
+ * bootc-classes.js - variant A surfaces S10 of docs/compose-variant-a-plan.md.
+ * This payload is appended to www/manager6/pvemanagerlib.js through the
+ * pvemanagerlib.js.patch hunk (the deb ships no www/ tree; a standalone
+ * file at the deb root would be dead weight). S9 wiring lives in the same
+ * patch: Workspace button, node command menu entry, tree type defaults and
+ * ordering, and the treeTypeToClass mapping to PVE.bootc.Status.
+ * Bootc guests have their OWN section; the LXC tree rendering is untouched.
+ *
+ * Classes:
+ *   PVE.bootc.Templates - grid of published seed templates (stack, image,
+ *                         compose source) + Create from Compose + per-row
+ *                         Edit (compose re-publish) / Clone (new guest).
+ *   PVE.bootc.Create    - Portainer-style compose editor: YAML textarea ->
+ *                         publish (build, smoke test, seed template) ->
+ *                         guest form prefilled with the new archive.
+ *   PVE.bootc.Editor    - compose editor for a published stack (re-publish).
+ *   PVE.bootc.Edit      - open a guest's recorded YAML, compose-refresh,
+ *                         rollback to the previous deployment.
+ *   PVE.bootc.Status    - start/stop/shutdown/destroy against
+ *                         nodes/{node}/bootc/{vmid} (Status API).
+ */
